meta {
  name: 1009 [DRAFT-V4D2] [LOCAL / TEST ONLY] Create activity suggestion set stops at 5 sets max (Hybrid B cap)
  type: http
  seq: 1009
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/parent/v1/ai/story-runs/{{phase_de_t2eb_maxed_run_id}}/activity-suggestions
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{bearerToken}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  X-Request-ID: {{request_id}}
  Content-Type: application/json
  Idempotency-Key: {{phase_de_t2eb_max_key}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "expected_understanding_revision": {{phase_de_t2eb_maxed_understanding_rev}}
  }
}

script:pre-request {
  bru.setVar("phase_de_t2eb_max_key", "t2eb-max-" + Date.now());
  if (!bru.getVar("phase_de_t2eb_maxed_understanding_rev")) {
    bru.setVar("phase_de_t2eb_maxed_understanding_rev", "1");
  }
}

tests {
  test("assert 5-set per-run cap conflict", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(409);
    expect(res.getBody().detail.code).to.equal("RESOURCE_CONFLICT");
  });
}

docs {
  DRAFT after Phase D/E: checked against committed Hybrid B code at 68c0fdf3; not yet run against a live backend.
  Role: Owning Parent - set bearerToken to seed-parent-p1 token
  Needs: needs-fixture: owned story run phase_de_t2eb_maxed_run_id already at 5 suggestion sets (understanding_revision in phase_de_t2eb_maxed_understanding_rev) with a fresh Idempotency-Key
  Expected: 409 / RESOURCE_CONFLICT (replays of earlier sets remain 200)
  UNVERIFIED: HTTP route cap refusal not executed end-to-end in 68c0fdf3 (proven at repository layer by test_parent_activity_suggestion_sets_postgres.py and HTTP error forwarding in parent_ai.py).
  Source: backend/src/sketch2life/infrastructure/persistence/parent_activity_suggestion_set_repository.py, backend/src/sketch2life/interfaces/http/routers/parent_ai.py, backend/tests/integration/test_parent_activity_suggestion_sets_postgres.py
}
